---
layout: base.njk
title: Products
description: Browse carpet, hybrid, timber, laminate and vinyl flooring. Request a free on-site quote.
---
<section class="wrap page">
  <h1>Our range</h1>
  <p class="lead">Quote only. Tap a product, request a quote and we will bring samples to you.</p>

  <div class="filters" id="filters">
    <button class="chip is-on" data-cat="all">All</button>
    {% for c in categories %}<button class="chip" data-cat="{{ c.key }}">{{ c.name }}</button>{% endfor %}
    <label class="search"><span class="sr">Search products</span><input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search products"></label>
  </div>

  {% if collections.catalogue.length %}
  <div class="grid" id="grid">
    {% for p in collections.catalogue %}{% include "card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="more"><button class="btn btn--ghost" id="more" hidden>Show more</button></p>
  <p class="empty" id="none" hidden>Nothing matches. <a href="/quote/">Ask us</a>, we can source it.</p>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty">The online range is being added. In the meantime <a href="/quote/">request a free on-site quote</a> and we will bring samples.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
